{"id":50299,"date":"2026-03-31T08:20:17","date_gmt":"2026-03-31T07:20:17","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=50299"},"modified":"2026-08-23T22:09:06","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T21:09:06","slug":"legua-de-tabua","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/legua-de-tabua\/","title":{"rendered":"L\u00e9gua de T\u00e1bua 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A I L\u00e9gua de T\u00e1bua realiza-se a <strong>25 de abril de 2026<\/strong>, coincidindo com as celebra\u00e7\u00f5es do Dia da Liberdade no concelho de T\u00e1bua. Este evento de atletismo de estrada integra o Calend\u00e1rio Regional da ADAC e acolhe o Campeonato Distrital de L\u00e9gua, atraindo os principais especialistas de m\u00e9dia dist\u00e2ncia da regi\u00e3o de Coimbra.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\ud83d\udccb <strong>Dados T\u00e9cnicos:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\" >\n<li><strong>Nome:<\/strong> I L\u00e9gua de T\u00e1bua \/ II Milha de T\u00e1bua Jovem<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Data:<\/strong> 25 de abril de 2026<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Local:<\/strong> T\u00e1bua, Distrito de Coimbra<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Terreno\/Dist\u00e2ncias:<\/strong> Estrada (Asfalto). A dist\u00e2ncia principal \u00e9 a L\u00e9gua (aproximadamente 5.000 metros), complementada pela II Milha de T\u00e1bua Jovem para os escal\u00f5es de forma\u00e7\u00e3o (at\u00e9 Sub-18).<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u2b50 <strong>Diferenciador:<\/strong> A prova serve de palco para o <strong>Campeonato Distrital de L\u00e9gua (CDPE)<\/strong>, garantindo um elevado n\u00edvel competitivo e a presen\u00e7a dos melhores clubes e atletas federados do distrito de Coimbra.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Sobre o Local:<\/strong> T\u00e1bua situa-se entre as serras da Estrela e do Caramulo, numa zona de transi\u00e7\u00e3o marcada pela beleza dos rios Mondego e Alva. Para a recupera\u00e7\u00e3o ap\u00f3s o esfor\u00e7o f\u00edsico, sugere-se o tradicional <strong>Queijo da Serra da Estrela<\/strong> (DOP) ou o <strong>Bucho Recheado de T\u00e1bua<\/strong>, ex-libris da gastronomia local.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":50300,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,478,624],"event_type_2":[37,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-50299","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-tabua-coimbra","event_type-corrida","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-kids","event_type_2-coimbra","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/7c5ab312bd04f703a03dfb838487b9ec-1.jpg","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50299","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=50299"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50299\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":61768,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50299\/revisions\/61768"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/50300"}],"wp:attachmen